.TH TROFF 1 "2026-10-14" "CUtils" "Test pages"
.SH NAME
troff \- a test page in the Unix man format
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B troff
[\fB\-ab\fR]
[\fIFILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
This paragraph is written on
two lines, joined and wrapped.
.B Bold words
and
.I underlined ones
and \fBinline bold\fR, a dash \- and quotes \(lqlike this\(rq.
.PP
A second paragraph.
.if n .ds X nothing to see
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-a
the first option.
.TP
.BR \-\-long ", " \-l
a long term goes on its own line.
.IP \(bu 4
a bullet item
.RS
.IP inner 8
an indented item
.RE
.SS Examples
.nf
troff \-a Work:
  kept as it is
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR man (1)
